  "title": "EnerSys Introduces DataSafe® HX530T and DataSafe® HX600T Batteries for Modern Data Center UPS Applications",
  "summary": "READING, Pa., — January 29, 2026 — EnerSys (NYSE: ENS), a global leader in stored energy solutions for industrial applications, today announced the introduction of the DataSafe® HX530T and DataSafe® HX600T batteries, new additions to the DataSafe® HX battery range designed for high-rate uninterruptible power supply (UPS) applications in data centers and other mission-critical environments.",
